"這裡無法讀取 maps.app.goo.gl 之類的短網址：請先開啟連結，再從瀏覽器網址列複製"
"完整網址。"

#: functions.php:323
msgid "Route stops"
msgstr "停留點"

#: functions.php:323
msgid ""
"One stop per line: Place name | location | short note. The location takes "
"the same forms as above."
msgstr "每行一個停留點：地點名稱 | 位置 | 簡短備註。位置的寫法與上方相同。"

#: functions.php:324
msgid "Starting point"
msgstr "出發點"

#: functions.php:326
msgid ""
"The map shows the stops in this order, joined by a straight line that is not "
"a road or walking route. Publish only coordinates you are comfortable "
"sharing. Empty coordinates mean no location."
msgstr ""
"地圖依此順序顯示停留點，並以直線連接；這條線不是道路或步行路線。請只公開願意"
"分享的座標。座標留空表示沒有位置。"

#: functions.php:462
msgid "GEOGRAPHIC CONTEXT"
msgstr "地理位置"

#: functions.php:464
msgid ""
"See where the places are in relation to each other, and select a pin to read "
"its note. Lines show the order of stops, not the actual route."
msgstr ""
"查看各地點的相對位置，點選圖釘即可閱讀備註。連線只表示停留順序，不代表實際路"
"線。"

